usage: wheel3 [-h] {unpack,pack,convert,tags,info,version,help} ...

positional arguments:
  {unpack,pack,convert,tags,info,version,help}
                        commands
    unpack              Unpack wheel
    pack                Repack wheel
    convert             Convert egg or wininst to wheel
    tags                Add or replace the tags on a wheel
    info                Show information about a wheel file
    version             Print version and exit
    help                Show this help

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
